nd burn them the  village of Moria is in a state of  emergency  stelios kathy otis and other villagers  meet here regularly to discuss ways to  deal with the situation the local mayor  Niko's truck alleys has just returned  from talks with the Greek government in  Athens the news isn't good if the  situation goes on like this it won't  take long before we have physical  confrontation up to now we are  tolerating the looting of people's  assets and it's fortunate that things  haven't become violent yet but it's a  matter of time before that happens  ahmed al Majid left his country to  escape violence he doesn't want to be  lumped together with lawbreakers he  wants to leave lesbos but for now a  ferry ticket to Athens remains just a  distant dream  you
 

